<title>FRANCE: Credit National posts 1996 profit fall.</title>
<headline>Credit National posts 1996 profit fall.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of French francs unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net attributable				98  vs	     524</p>
<p>    Net dividend (francs)			 10  vs	    13.5</p>
<p>    Net banking income			 3,939  vs	   4,079</p>
<p>    Operating income			   1,224  vs	   1,372</p>
<p>    Restructuring provision		    250  vs	   nil</p>
<p>    Solvency ratio (pct)			 9.01 vs	    9.35</p>
<p>NOTE - Credit National presented pro-forma 1995 figures to reflect the acquisition of trading bank BFCE.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
